   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) am&#xe9;lioration de la durabilit&#xe9; &#xe0; long terme de la biobanque et du laboratoire; 2) am&#xe9;lioration de la capacit&#xe9; de la Sierra Leone &#xe0; pr&#xe9;venir et &#xe0; d&#xe9;tecter les menaces biologiques et &#xe0; y r&#xe9;pondre; 3) r&#xe9;duction de l&#x2019;acc&#xe8;s des acteurs non &#xe9;tatiques aux mati&#xe8;res biologiques &#xe0; haut risque.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) improved long-term sustainability of the biobank and laboratory; (2) enhanced readiness of Sierra Leone to prevent, detect and respond to biological threats; and (3) reduced access to high-consequence biological materials by non-state actors.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
